open K1A_14_3 Finset
open K1_14 hiding AdjacentChart JetSource PrefixCover ReducedEquation TerminalDivisibility TerminalMass adjacent_chart c1 c2 c3 c4 c5 c6 forcedPower of_children rawVolume rawWidth retained_price scheduled seedGain separant_certificate simplePrice singularDegree singular_count singular_degree_lt subbankDebit terminalMass_of_source terminalShape trim twist_lift
open K1A_14
